sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CL as Клиент
    participant R as report-service
    participant C as core-service
    participant M as media-service
    participant G as Gotenberg
    participant S3 as SeaweedFS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (report)
    CL->>R: POST /api/v1/reports {inspectionId}
    R->>C: GET /internal/v1/access/properties/{id}?userId&action=read
    C-->>R: 200 / 404
    R->>DB: INSERT report_jobs (QUEUED)
    R-->>CL: 202 {id, status: QUEUED}
    loop Воркер (SELECT … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
        R->>DB: status = RUNNING
        R->>C: GET /internal/v1/inspections/{id}/report-data
        C-->>R: 200 агрегат осмотра (JSON)
        par Для каждого фото
            R->>M: GET /internal/v1/photos/{id}/content?variant=preview
            M-->>R: image/jpeg
        end
        R->>R: html/template + встраивание фото (data URI)
        R->>G: POST /forms/chromium/convert/html (index.html)
        G-->>R: application/pdf
        R->>R: Проверка: страницы, размер ≤ лимита
        R->>S3: PUT reports/{inspectionId}/{jobId}.pdf
        R->>DB: status = DONE, page_count, size_bytes
    end
    alt Ошибка (core/media/Gotenberg недоступны)
        R->>DB: attempts += 1, next_attempt_at (до 3 попыток) → FAILED
    end
    CL->>R: GET /api/v1/reports/{id} (опрос каждые 2 с)
    R-->>CL: 200 {status: DONE}
    CL->>R: GET /api/v1/reports/{id}/file
    R->>S3: GET объекта
    R-->>CL: 200 application/pdf
